JohtoRoute30_MrPokemonsHouse_Text_BeforeReferral::
    .string "Welcome! I am MR. POKEMON.\n"
    .string "I am preparing a report for ELM.\p"
    .string "Speak with the GUIDE GENT in\n"
    .string "CHERRYGROVE about helping out.$"

JohtoRoute30_MrPokemonsHouse_Text_ResearchReport::
    .string "You are the visitor helping ELM!\n"
    .string "The GUIDE GENT sent you, then.\p"
    .string "A POKEMON EGG found in JOHTO\n"
    .string "can teach us something new.\p"
    .string "I will keep the EGG safe here.\n"
    .string "Please take my notes to ELM.\p"
    .string "His lab team can compare them\n"
    .string "with the records from KANTO.\p"
    .string "Tell his assistant in NEW BARK\n"
    .string "that my report is ready.$"

JohtoRoute30_MrPokemonsHouse_Text_Repeat::
    .string "My report is ready for ELM.\n"
    .string "Speak with his lab assistant.\p"
    .string "The EGG stays here for study.\n"
    .string "Thank you for carrying the news.$"

JohtoRoute30_MrPokemonsHouse_Text_AfterReport::
    .string "ELM received the report!\n"
    .string "Our research can move forward.\p"
    .string "Records from different regions\n"
    .string "help us understand POKEMON.$"

JohtoRoute30_MrPokemonsHouse_Text_OaksAide::
    .string "PROF. OAK sent me from KANTO\n"
    .string "to compare research with ELM.\p"
    .string "PROF. BIRCH is studying POKEMON\n"
    .string "in HOENN as well.\p"
    .string "A region changes the order of\n"
    .string "its POKEDEX, not your records.$"

JohtoRoute30_MrPokemonsHouse_Text_AideAfterReport::
    .string "Thank you for linking our work!\n"
    .string "OAK will be glad to hear of it.\p"
    .string "Your discoveries stay with you\n"
    .string "when another region is unlocked.$"

